{"turn_id": "d03-t1", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_size", "text": "根据该论文，FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条来自 5.4M 篇维基百科文章语料的声称（claims）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t2", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_size", "text": "论文称 FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 18.5 万条 claims（185k），语料库为 540 万篇（5.4M）维基百科文章。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_labels", "text": "FEVER 数据集中的 claims 依据证据集被标注为“SUPPORTS”、“REFUTES”或“NOT ENOUGH INFO”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_challenge", "text": "FEVER 是 Fact Extraction and VERification (FEVER) 挑战赛的一部分，该挑战赛随数据集一同发布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t3", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_size_1910", "text": "论文1910.07154指出，FEVER是最大的数据集，包含约185k条claims，语料库为5.4M篇Wikipedia文章。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "no_fever_in_1603", "text": "论文1603.09381未提及FEVER数据集，其工作聚焦于Mayo Clinic临床笔记与病理报告的临床信息抽取。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"}]}, {"key": "perf_1910", "text": "论文1910.07154报告：在转换后数据集的开发集上标签准确率为80.2%，测试集上为80.25%，其中“SUPPORTS”标签准确率为80.2%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}, {"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "no_baseline_gain_1910", "text": "所给证据未给出1910.07154相对任何基线的提升幅度数值。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "no_gain_1603", "text": "所给证据中1603.09381未报告模型相对基线的性能提升幅度；仅提到传统方法使用cTAKES特征且特征工程耗时。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"}]}, {"key": "comparability", "text": "两篇论文任务与数据集不同（FEVER事实核查 vs Mayo Clinic临床信息抽取），所给证据不足以支持对数据集规模或性能提升进行可比性比较。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}, {"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t3", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
